{
    desc => q{Count prefix 10j moves cursor down 10 lines},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
Macro: `xt/visual/macros/count_prefix_10j`

Tests that a numeric count prefix (`10j`) moves the cursor down exactly 10 lines from the starting position.

Keys: `10j`

- **count_prefix_10j_initial.png**: Cursor at line 1, col 0 on `l` of "line 01"
- **count_prefix_10j_after_10j.png**: Cursor at line 11, col 0 on `l` of "line 11" (moved down 10 lines)
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('10j');
        $ctx->delay(200);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_10j');
    },
